# Resend (https://resend.com) powers the Contact form's outbound email.
# Create an API key at https://resend.com/api-keys and paste it below.
# Without this set, the contact route returns a 500 and the UI falls back
# to a mailto link — the site still builds and runs fine.
RESEND_API_KEY=

# Cloudflare Turnstile (https://developers.cloudflare.com/turnstile) guards the
# Contact form from bots. Set both together (or neither): the public site key
# renders the widget, the secret verifies tokens server-side. Without them the
# form works unguarded.
NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
TURNSTILE_SECRET=
